<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-KOSTNER WINS WOMEN'S SUPER-G.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-KOSTNER WINS WOMEN'S SUPER-G.</headline>
<dateline>CORTINA D'AMPEZZO, Italy 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isolde Kostner of Italy won a women's Alpine skiing World Cup super G on Saturday, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Kostner clocked a time of one minute 17.04 seconds. Sweden's Pernilla Wiberg was second in 1:17.14 and Germany's Katja Seizinger third in 1:17.24.</p>
